WEBVTT

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:21.100
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.870
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:32.640
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.580
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:43.420
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:50.100
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:55.800
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:00.970
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:06.780
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:13.290
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:18.960
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:24.100
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.860
Shine the light!

00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:32.406
It's here.

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:45.396
Hoshimura-san!

00:01:49.336 --> 00:01:50.576
I'm sorry...

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:51.666
What?

00:02:09.756 --> 00:02:11.126
I'm sorry...

00:02:11.126 --> 00:02:13.096
What?

00:02:13.096 --> 00:02:16.766
For not being able to protect Keisei...

00:02:16.766 --> 00:02:20.426
All this time, I've been
wanting to say that to you...

00:02:25.106 --> 00:02:27.776
I'm... sorry...

00:02:27.776 --> 00:02:33.076
Ah, well... don't cry, okay? Okay?

00:02:34.886 --> 00:02:40.416
Here. Crying... doesn't suit you.

00:02:42.626 --> 00:02:43.596
What?

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.796
That aside...

00:02:45.796 --> 00:02:47.566
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:51.396
Why are you here?
And dressing like that...

00:02:51.396 --> 00:02:53.406
What on earth are you doing?!

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:57.776
I'm training with Takamasa-sensei right now.

00:02:57.776 --> 00:03:02.146
And then, I heard that
you were in danger, so...

00:03:06.646 --> 00:03:09.586
To the very end, Keisei tried to protect you!

00:03:09.586 --> 00:03:13.956
And yet, you'd do
something dangerous like this!

00:03:13.956 --> 00:03:18.496
But I... became your contracted monk!

00:03:18.496 --> 00:03:21.826
We didn't have any other
choice then. That's all.

00:03:21.826 --> 00:03:25.766
The only contracted monk
I'll accept... is Keisei.

00:03:26.536 --> 00:03:29.766
Then, you will... uhm...

00:03:31.136 --> 00:03:33.836
I'm dead to begin with.

00:03:37.616 --> 00:03:41.346
Why did you become a contracted monk?

00:03:41.346 --> 00:03:42.346
What?

00:03:42.346 --> 00:03:44.486
What's your reason for fighting?

00:03:44.486 --> 00:03:50.656
The reason... It's...
because Brother asked me to...

00:03:50.656 --> 00:03:52.496
Because he asked you to?!

00:03:52.496 --> 00:03:55.796
You risk your life and fight just
because someone asked you to?!

00:03:55.796 --> 00:03:59.026
No, I didn't mean that. It's just...

00:04:00.066 --> 00:04:03.376
I'm worried about you...

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:05.736
Hey, what're you doing there?!

00:04:09.646 --> 00:04:14.016
This isn't someplace that
people can just enter as they please!

00:04:19.756 --> 00:04:22.896
Kurai?! Is that you Kurai, hey?!

00:04:22.896 --> 00:04:25.926
What did you guys do to Kurai?!

00:04:25.926 --> 00:04:28.756
What did we do? He was...

00:04:32.366 --> 00:04:33.356
Don't move!

00:04:41.546 --> 00:04:45.116
To think that he easily
entered the purification chamber...

00:04:45.116 --> 00:04:46.716
Could he be a Shikabane?!

00:04:46.716 --> 00:04:49.876
He's Gon-Sojo Tagami's brother.

00:04:53.786 --> 00:04:56.446
I'm Honda, an Inspector.

00:05:02.396 --> 00:05:04.536
What's going on?!

00:05:04.536 --> 00:05:09.436
Open, my zadan technique!
On-Jiri-Chei-Sowaka...

00:05:09.436 --> 00:05:13.736
He's calling a group of
Shikabane from the bowels of the earth.

00:05:18.746 --> 00:05:20.046
Sadahiro!

00:05:25.416 --> 00:05:26.616
No way...

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:32.296
Incredible Lotus Flower!

00:06:03.126 --> 00:06:06.796
So this is the backyard of the
Kougon Sect's head temple...

00:06:06.796 --> 00:06:09.296
The air seems tense somehow.

00:06:09.296 --> 00:06:13.766
It's surrounded by a purifier
that's used to exorcise defilement.

00:06:13.766 --> 00:06:17.376
If we stay here long, even we will become...

00:06:17.376 --> 00:06:19.106
Will become what?

00:06:19.106 --> 00:06:22.476
We'll become unable to move, pops.

00:06:22.476 --> 00:06:23.316
"Grr"
We'll become unable to move, pops.

00:06:23.316 --> 00:06:23.846
We'll become unable to move, pops.

00:06:23.846 --> 00:06:24.836
Humph!

00:06:26.116 --> 00:06:29.456
Isaka-dono is right.

00:06:29.456 --> 00:06:33.116
Maybe this plan was a
little reckless after all...

00:06:35.856 --> 00:06:40.956
Well, we'll be sure to leave
before it becomes dangerous.

00:06:45.336 --> 00:06:50.296
The mirror got... broken... The mirror...

00:06:51.206 --> 00:06:54.666
It seems that Hokuto has already found her.

00:06:59.586 --> 00:07:01.576
Zadan technique...

00:07:02.516 --> 00:07:04.086
- Please get out of here!
- Isaka!

00:07:04.086 --> 00:07:05.716
Eyes of Asura!

00:07:19.736 --> 00:07:22.226
They disappeared? No way...

00:07:23.576 --> 00:07:26.006
Looks like they've escaped into their trench!

00:07:32.846 --> 00:07:36.376
Stop it! What're you going
to do to Hoshimura-san?!

00:07:36.916 --> 00:07:40.526
It's no longer possible to purify the
defilement of this Shikabane Hime.

00:07:40.526 --> 00:07:41.586
What?!

00:07:41.586 --> 00:07:45.126
Attacking an Inspector is a terrible deed.

00:07:45.126 --> 00:07:47.196
We have no choice but to kill her.

00:07:47.196 --> 00:07:49.696
That person had become a Shikabane!

00:07:49.696 --> 00:07:53.536
The Kougon Sect's monks abandon
things like regrets and obsessions

00:07:53.536 --> 00:07:55.306
and attain Enlightenment.

00:07:55.306 --> 00:07:57.536
They never become Shikabane!

00:07:59.036 --> 00:08:02.036
Are you going to pretend
that nothing ever happened?!

00:08:08.986 --> 00:08:10.916
Don't move!

00:08:12.216 --> 00:08:15.986
What do you think you're doing... Genpaku?

00:08:15.986 --> 00:08:20.996
Please let my fellow disciple
and that Shikabane Hime go.

00:08:20.996 --> 00:08:22.756
Fellow disciple?

00:08:24.236 --> 00:08:29.906
Ouri Kagami has been training under
my Master for the past six months.

00:08:29.906 --> 00:08:32.606
His Grace Sojo Umehara, huh?

00:08:32.606 --> 00:08:37.446
However, his contract is only temporary.

00:08:37.446 --> 00:08:40.586
So you do admit that he has the contract.

00:08:40.586 --> 00:08:41.786
What?

00:08:41.786 --> 00:08:44.256
I'm happy for you, Makina-chan.

00:08:45.756 --> 00:08:48.786
What're you happy about, seriously...

00:08:48.786 --> 00:08:50.956
Makina-chan, here!

00:08:54.426 --> 00:08:56.766
I can't believe you...

00:08:57.466 --> 00:08:59.366
Oh, how scary.

00:08:59.366 --> 00:09:01.466
Don't be so upset, Makina-chan.

00:09:01.466 --> 00:09:03.456
I found her...

00:09:23.626 --> 00:09:25.226
No way...

00:09:25.226 --> 00:09:30.566
This is a trench...
a space created by a Shikabane...

00:09:30.566 --> 00:09:32.236
Isn't there an entrance?

00:09:32.236 --> 00:09:33.736
Does this mean that a Shikabane

00:09:33.736 --> 00:09:38.236
who has a curse powerful enough to
build a trench infiltrated this place?

00:09:38.236 --> 00:09:39.806
What is this place?!

00:09:39.806 --> 00:09:41.506
Inspector!

00:09:41.506 --> 00:09:42.906
Don't panic!

00:09:42.906 --> 00:09:44.536
Oh?

00:09:44.916 --> 00:09:49.756
Looks like we caught
a few extras... Oh well...

00:09:49.756 --> 00:09:53.046
Akasha... the traitor monk...

00:09:59.596 --> 00:10:03.196
First, let me introduce you.

00:10:03.196 --> 00:10:08.236
These people are indeed
the enemy of all living people.

00:10:08.236 --> 00:10:10.666
They are the Seven Stars.

00:10:20.886 --> 00:10:25.756
We finally meet, daughter of Hoshimura.

00:10:27.586 --> 00:10:29.856
Do you remember...

00:10:29.856 --> 00:10:33.096
...the day you desperately begged
for forgiveness in a sea of blood

00:10:33.096 --> 00:10:37.366
after you couldn't die even once your
arms and legs had been torn off?

00:10:37.366 --> 00:10:41.266
Humph! She's forgotten out of fear.

00:10:57.886 --> 00:10:59.146
Hoshimura-san!

00:11:00.426 --> 00:11:04.586
Where're you going? Just watch quietly.

00:11:07.896 --> 00:11:10.596
What's the matter, daughter of Hoshimura?

00:11:10.596 --> 00:11:14.766
Weren't you going to destroy us?

00:11:14.766 --> 00:11:18.306
I was killed by you.

00:11:18.306 --> 00:11:22.776
My family, too...
Everyone was... Everyone was...

00:11:22.776 --> 00:11:25.016
I will destroy you all.

00:11:25.016 --> 00:11:28.186
To achieve that goal...
To achieve that goal!

00:11:28.186 --> 00:11:32.846
To destroy the Seven Stars...
That's your regret?

00:11:34.626 --> 00:11:36.746
How small...

00:11:37.026 --> 00:11:41.466
There's no way that you can
destroy us with a petty regret.

00:11:41.466 --> 00:11:43.296
She can't destroy you?

00:11:43.296 --> 00:11:48.636
You guys are Shikabane, too, who came
back to this world due to your regrets!

00:11:48.636 --> 00:11:51.136
That's not true, young man.

00:11:51.136 --> 00:11:53.846
We don't act on things like regrets.

00:11:53.846 --> 00:11:57.816
What makes us, the Seven Stars, act is...

00:11:57.816 --> 00:12:00.306
our nature.

00:12:03.456 --> 00:12:07.556
What?! The Seven Stars are
near the purification chamber?!

00:12:07.556 --> 00:12:09.786
The information is accurate.

00:12:10.626 --> 00:12:15.166
Sojo Takamine, you have to stay here.

00:12:15.166 --> 00:12:16.156
Hm?

00:12:16.896 --> 00:12:20.666
The purification chamber is a
short distance from the head temple.

00:12:20.666 --> 00:12:24.306
It's our duty to protect Dai-Sojo.

00:12:24.306 --> 00:12:30.146
However, Makina Hoshimura is in
the chamber... so are many soldier monks!

00:12:30.146 --> 00:12:32.406
We can't leave them be!

00:12:41.426 --> 00:12:44.056
What're you doing, Flesh?!

00:12:44.056 --> 00:12:46.096
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:46.096 --> 00:12:50.596
My Master told me that he'd make
me eat a tree frog if I didn't do it!

00:12:50.596 --> 00:12:52.936
What're you saying, you raw meat?!

00:12:52.936 --> 00:12:57.436
Ahhh! You're pretending that you
didn't say that?! That's playing dirty!

00:12:57.436 --> 00:13:03.876
What can I do? It's the nature of men.

00:13:03.876 --> 00:13:07.286
Umehara, I thought
you were in the mountains.

00:13:07.286 --> 00:13:10.886
Well, a lot is going on...

00:13:10.886 --> 00:13:15.926
Ah, if you like, shall I go
there to greet... the Seven Stars?

00:13:15.926 --> 00:13:16.956
Umehara!

00:13:16.956 --> 00:13:21.296
But there's something I
want to borrow for a while.

00:13:22.096 --> 00:13:24.436
That thing for exorcisms...

00:13:24.436 --> 00:13:28.966
You can't! It's something that
His Grace Dai-Sojo sealed once...

00:13:28.966 --> 00:13:31.806
Please don't be so stingy.

00:13:31.806 --> 00:13:34.936
After all, I'm the only
one who can handle it.

00:13:38.646 --> 00:13:42.916
"Nature" is the scream from
a heart that wants to escape.

00:13:42.916 --> 00:13:45.256
In other words, it's people's real nature.

00:13:45.256 --> 00:13:46.586
Real nature?

00:13:46.586 --> 00:13:52.256
Regrets are just subtle
obsessions that occur right before death.

00:13:52.256 --> 00:13:57.766
One's nature is the feeling that has
been growing in the person's heart

00:13:57.766 --> 00:13:59.566
ever since he was born.

00:13:59.566 --> 00:14:03.776
It's his roots, something
he himself cannot control.

00:14:03.776 --> 00:14:09.676
Every human lives while
suppressing and denying that nature.

00:14:09.676 --> 00:14:14.646
But we, the Seven Stars,
released that nature.

00:14:14.646 --> 00:14:16.816
We live following our nature.

00:14:16.816 --> 00:14:22.086
That is to say that we
indeed are the true humans.

00:14:27.266 --> 00:14:31.966
To see her fighting without
her nature, just based on regrets...

00:14:31.966 --> 00:14:34.366
I guess we were wrong...

00:14:44.276 --> 00:14:45.266
Hm?

00:14:45.616 --> 00:14:48.516
I won't let you kill Hoshimura-san!

00:14:48.516 --> 00:14:53.826
That girl's been dead for a
long time. She's just a Shikabane.

00:14:53.826 --> 00:14:56.126
Even so, I'll protect her!

00:14:56.126 --> 00:15:01.026
Do you have feelings
for that Shikabane Hime?

00:15:02.626 --> 00:15:08.636
You love a Shikabane and fight
for her. There's no reason for it...

00:15:08.636 --> 00:15:13.806
So that's your instinct
and your nature as well?

00:15:13.806 --> 00:15:16.076
That's interesting, young man.

00:15:16.076 --> 00:15:20.746
Do you wanna become a
Shikabane with that nature?

00:15:33.096 --> 00:15:37.726
I'm sorry... for not being
able to protect Keisei...

00:15:46.746 --> 00:15:49.676
Thanks, Makina.

00:15:49.676 --> 00:15:54.686
The days that we fought
together weren't too bad.

00:15:54.686 --> 00:15:56.676
It was fun.

00:15:58.886 --> 00:16:03.416
So... please smile...

00:16:04.796 --> 00:16:08.286
In my last moments, let me see your smile...

00:16:09.566 --> 00:16:12.756
Smile... Makina...

00:16:17.606 --> 00:16:20.076
No...

00:16:20.076 --> 00:16:22.206
That's not it...

00:16:24.316 --> 00:16:26.246
I...

00:16:27.486 --> 00:16:29.106
It's all...

00:16:30.586 --> 00:16:32.276
I...

00:16:35.086 --> 00:16:36.576
Keisei...

00:16:39.296 --> 00:16:40.586
Keisei...

00:16:43.226 --> 00:16:44.496
Keisei...

00:16:47.106 --> 00:16:48.596
Keisei...

00:16:51.506 --> 00:16:52.766
Keisei...

00:16:55.646 --> 00:16:57.106
Keisei...

00:16:59.616 --> 00:17:00.976
Keisei...

00:17:02.986 --> 00:17:04.576
Keisei!

00:17:09.526 --> 00:17:13.496
We're standing in a nameless place

00:17:13.496 --> 00:17:14.626
We're standing in a nameless place
Oh? How interesting.

00:17:14.626 --> 00:17:15.966
Everything starts here
Oh? How interesting.

00:17:15.966 --> 00:17:20.036
Everything starts here
So you've awoken, daughter of Hoshimura.

00:17:20.036 --> 00:17:21.836
I'm not exactly filled with courage
Keisei...

00:17:21.836 --> 00:17:25.176
I'm not exactly filled with courage
To think that you can gather that
much power from petty regrets...

00:17:25.176 --> 00:17:25.836
but you told me that a little was enough
To think that you can gather that
much power from petty regrets...

00:17:25.836 --> 00:17:27.476
but you told me that a little was enough
Keisei...

00:17:27.476 --> 00:17:29.876
but you told me that a little was enough
This is truly interesting.

00:17:29.876 --> 00:17:30.946
But you told me that a little was enough
Were you the one who killed Keisei?!

00:17:30.946 --> 00:17:33.516
No matter how harsh a path awaits me
Were you the one who killed Keisei?!

00:17:33.516 --> 00:17:35.886
No matter how harsh a path awaits me

00:17:35.886 --> 00:17:41.556
even if the raging wind blocks my way

00:17:41.556 --> 00:17:46.556
the changing seasons won't wait for me

00:17:46.556 --> 00:17:50.666
I just press forward, hand-in-hand with you

00:17:50.666 --> 00:17:51.566
I just press forward, hand-in-hand with you
What's with her movements?!

00:17:51.566 --> 00:17:53.066
Let's go, I'm not scared
What's with her movements?!

00:17:53.066 --> 00:17:55.206
Let's go, I'm not scared
The power of a curse...

00:17:55.206 --> 00:17:56.736
Let's go, I'm not scared
It's not just regrets.

00:17:56.736 --> 00:17:57.376
As long as I'm with you...
It's not just regrets.

00:17:57.376 --> 00:18:01.906
As long as I'm with you...
I hold the guns for the
reason I decided... for Keisei!

00:18:01.906 --> 00:18:03.736
As long as I'm with you...

00:18:05.716 --> 00:18:07.976
I am a Shikabane Hime!

00:18:09.386 --> 00:18:10.976
Die!

00:18:23.026 --> 00:18:25.256
The mirror...

00:18:27.236 --> 00:18:30.496
The broken... mirror...

00:18:44.416 --> 00:18:48.046
Knocking down that cursed
Shikabane Hime with one hit...

00:18:48.926 --> 00:18:50.796
What on earth is Hokuto-sama?

00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:53.696
It's not that she is fighting.

00:18:53.696 --> 00:18:56.126
She just wants to know
who she's dealing with.

00:18:56.126 --> 00:19:00.936
That's right. She doesn't
have regrets or nature.

00:19:00.936 --> 00:19:06.606
Her life was taken for no reason
and she became a Shikabane.

00:19:06.606 --> 00:19:10.776
Knowing others...
Having something to do with others...

00:19:10.776 --> 00:19:13.616
To her, those are the same
as learning the meaning of life.

00:19:13.616 --> 00:19:17.786
Having something to do with
others means killing, though.

00:19:17.786 --> 00:19:18.616
- She is death itself.

00:19:18.616 --> 00:19:21.926
- The broken mirror... Show it to me...
- She is death itself.

00:19:21.926 --> 00:19:25.486
- I wanna see... I wanna see more...
- That's exactly why she's
the symbol of the Seven Stars.

00:19:36.736 --> 00:19:39.606
So this is... the Seven Stars...

00:19:50.086 --> 00:19:55.456
Good grief...
What a strong trench you guys built...

00:19:55.456 --> 00:19:58.856
A human broke my trench?!

00:19:59.756 --> 00:20:02.596
Too bad, huh, Seven Stars.

00:20:10.476 --> 00:20:12.996
Looks like the game is over.

00:20:18.216 --> 00:20:19.706
Akasha!

00:20:20.516 --> 00:20:22.286
At a time like this!

00:20:22.286 --> 00:20:23.116
Who's that?

00:20:23.116 --> 00:20:25.786
A contracted monk? I've never seen him.

00:20:25.786 --> 00:20:27.486
That man is...

00:20:27.486 --> 00:20:29.626
Could it be... Sadahiro?!

00:20:29.626 --> 00:20:33.646
What the heck? Has everybody
involved gathered here or something?

00:20:37.736 --> 00:20:40.736
Unfortunately, the power of the Seven Stars

00:20:40.736 --> 00:20:45.236
is restrained in this place
by the Kougon Sect's purifier.

00:20:45.236 --> 00:20:48.406
On top of that, the top warrior monk

00:20:48.406 --> 00:20:50.976
who received the title of
Genpaku despite his youth...

00:20:50.976 --> 00:20:54.246
The current head of the Aragami Family,
one of the Ten Great Holy Families...

00:20:54.246 --> 00:20:58.886
The only Sojo who can handle the
divine sword of exorcism, the Acala Sword...

00:20:58.886 --> 00:21:03.086
And the man who probably has
the strongest zadan technique...

00:21:03.086 --> 00:21:07.226
If we are to fight with these four
along with their Shikabane Hime,

00:21:07.226 --> 00:21:11.696
the Seven Stars also need to be
prepared to sacrifice quite a bit.

00:21:11.696 --> 00:21:15.266
Makina Hoshimura, I'll admit...

00:21:15.266 --> 00:21:18.236
that you've become our,
the Seven Stars' enemy...

00:21:18.236 --> 00:21:21.576
a hateful and lovable enemy...

00:21:21.576 --> 00:21:26.746
But don't forget...
That's something we desired.

00:21:26.746 --> 00:21:33.386
Your existence is also part of our plan.

00:21:33.386 --> 00:21:38.526
Next time we meet,
you'll come to realize that.

00:21:38.526 --> 00:21:41.626
I will completely destroy you all.

00:21:41.626 --> 00:21:46.696
Just like you did to me, I will
take everything away from you.

00:21:46.696 --> 00:21:50.766
I, Makina Hoshimura...
a Shikabane Hime will!

00:22:15.396 --> 00:22:21.266
The new world is now a mirage

00:22:21.266 --> 00:22:27.776
that appears so close to me

00:22:27.776 --> 00:22:33.676
Once I say goodbye to this boring life,

00:22:33.676 --> 00:22:39.756
infinite possibilities await me

00:22:39.756 --> 00:22:42.756
I now cherish the silhouette of hope

00:22:42.756 --> 00:22:45.756
and endlessly seek it out

00:22:45.756 --> 00:22:48.696
With a heart that holds strong
against even Ioneliness,

00:22:48.696 --> 00:22:52.596
I face the future

00:22:52.596 --> 00:22:57.006
Even if the dream doesn't end,

00:22:57.006 --> 00:23:03.466
I don't want to give in

00:23:04.116 --> 00:23:10.046
How many worrisome nights
have there been, have I overcome?

00:23:10.046 --> 00:23:14.856
I've thought long and hard
about why I was born,

00:23:14.856 --> 00:23:21.626
and greeted the morning without an answer

00:23:25.636 --> 00:23:28.566
You like her? Are you saying you love her?

00:23:28.566 --> 00:23:33.506
What's inside that figure of a girl...

00:23:33.506 --> 00:23:40.036
Now, go ahead and tear up that
"beloved aberration" to check...
